{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","自然之怒"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","创造持续数秒的乌云，降下雷电打击敌人。敌人处于控制状态时，敌人会受到更多次雷击。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个地图格，对该格2格范围内的所有敌人造成160% + 20% ATK伤害，同时在该范围上空生成持续7秒的乌云，乌云会雷击下方处于控制状态的敌人，造成80% + 10% ATK伤害。同一名敌人每2秒最多被雷击1次。优先选择敌军最密集的区域释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":80,"end":86,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","首次雷击造成180% + 20% ATK伤害，乌云后续雷击造成90% + 10% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","首次雷击造成190% + 20% ATK伤害，乌云后续雷击造成95% + 10% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","首次雷击造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，乌云后续雷击造成100% + 10% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}